  note   = {The preflight's pass line read that nine domain witnesses were still ahead. Measured
            against the gate: it invokes eight, three mypy and three ruff and two ratchet-gate.
            A hand-written population inside the instrument whose whole job is predicting that
            gate, and it passed every arithmetic check because nothing about the number was
            malformed --- a correct-looking figure over a population nobody enumerated. The
            figure moves by construction, since a witness is added by writing one line, so a
            hardcoded number describing something designed to grow rots silently and reports the
            rot as reassurance. The count is now derived from the gate itself, and reported as
