            untracked modules would vendor a snapshot nobody can fetch. So the section reported a
            true fact under a heading that made it look actionable, and thirty-two lines of a
            peer's working state listed among blockers trains a reader to scroll past thirty-two
            lines --- the furniture rule reached by volume rather than by constancy. The section
            is kept because the count is still evidence about a peer, and it now names its own
            status and cites the commit that inverted the dependency, in an emitted line rather
            than a comment.},
