            distributions end in a newline today, so the counts agreed at 216, 88 and 37: the
            accident holding rather than the property being enforced, for the third consecutive
            tick. The gate now counts per file, which is correct independent of file endings; a
            lint rule forbidding the missing newline would have fixed the accident and left the
