  note   = {A skipped-test count read four against twenty-three, a warrant total agreed only
            while no entry carried the delimiter off column zero, and a test-function count
            agreed only while every module ended in a newline. Each was found by reading rather
            than by a check, so the class is what has leverage and it is enumerable: a derivation
            is an assignment whose value counts a literal, and two derivations counting the same
            literal derive the same quantity. The grouping key is a witness from the source
            rather than a judgement that two expressions mean the same thing, which is the rule
            that an identification without a witness is the reader's convenience. Measured:
            fourteen counting derivations, three literals counted more than once, all three
            groups agreeing after the previous repairs. The checker fires on the pre-repair blob
            pair, naming the anchored and unanchored forms of the same subject, and goes clean at
            the commit that repaired it --- so it would have caught that defect a tick earlier
            without anyone reading for it.},
